@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### GET all swap requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/swapRequests?sortBy=createdAt&sortDir=asc

### Get swap request by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/swapRequests/d2773ca2-d632-48a6-9e78-12ddd471ad24

### POST swap request
POST {{baseUrl}}/swapRequests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requester": "Ihor",
  "targetUser": "Marlboro",
  "shiftId": "c2a54125-0a76-46b1-8469-3e1b90620a13"
}

### PUT swap request
PUT {{baseUrl}}/swapRequests/e289de23-8266-4201-9534-a7e2aa7545d2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requester": "Ihor",
  "targetUser": "Marlboro",
  "shiftId": "c2a54125-0a76-46b1-8469-3e1b90620a13",
  "status": "approved"
}

### DELETE swap req
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/swapRequests/e289de23-8266-4201-9534-a7e2aa7545d2